                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This was the very game which defined lot of things during my teenage years. \n\n(i) I begged my parents for 286 PC after seeing this game from my friends house. TV console game and action figures were thrown away right after I got my own PC and RTK2.\n\n(ii) Realized how fun it is to pretend to sleep until your parents go to bed and wake up in the middle of the night to play for hours and hours until morning came.\n\n(iii) Became a serious history buff. Got interested in RTK, then to Chinese history, then to world history so forth. \n\nI am just so glad to be able to see this game in Steam. If there is one little favor I ask of Tecmo Koei, it is to please provide English version for hundreds and thousands of KOEI lovers out there.",
